      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="mt-6 relative z-10">
    <button type="button" class="w-full py-2.5 px-5 rounded-xl bg-[#4E2A18] hover:bg-[#3D1E10] text-white text-[13.5px] font-semibold flex items-center justify-center gap-2 transition-colors duration-150 shadow-sm">
      <span class="">Ver privacidad</span>
      <span class="text-xs font-bold">›</span>
    </button>
  </div>
